  "change": {
    "summary": "Standalone golden Life Chorus with shared player-origin repulsion for V and guardian entry; sequential Bloom, sonic Sculk, native lava drinking and purple Void estimate.",
    "modifiers": [
      {
        "property": "sandbox.nether_main_skill",
        "operation": "replace",
        "before": "V: approved R5 three-hit fiery slash.",
        "after": "V: five independently exposed floors +/-10Y, continuous fissure/fire flanks and three magma models. Approved B fire combo unchanged. Ordinary right-click lava bucket:32-tick native DRINK, empty bucket and heal5; sneak-right-click retains pouring. No drinking B combo."
      },
      {
        "property": "sandbox.void_main_skill",
        "operation": "replace",
        "before": "Immediate canonical targeted safe teleport, old Void cuboid variants.",
        "after": "Native tapered End portal tear and tick14 safe teleport, pursuer refresh without stale decoy. B hold>=10ticks launches safe-arrival pearl; read-only purple ballistic impact/distance estimate replaces face-obscuring charge orb. Sneak+B100ticks75% gravity reduction retained."
      },
      {
        "property": "sandbox.bloom_main_skill",
        "operation": "replace",
        "before": "Canonical root damage/slow with coffer visual.",
        "after": "Base6 raw damage once per hostile Mob in10-block AABB and brief adaptive woody wrap; no action lock. Three sequential F6 sandbox unlocks: I90tick full hostile action pause with native health/fire/status clocks; II3 raw magic damage at20/40/60/80 ticks; III Poison I once at start90ticks. Saved NBT and copied on respawn. Chunky angular brown lower roots, green leaves and independent branch tracks retained. B temporary leaf path unchanged."
      },
      {
        "property": "sandbox.sculk_main_skill",
        "operation": "replace",
        "before": "Canonical connected-sculk traversal with crawl cuboid.",
        "after": "V no traversal: horizontal8-block sonic wave at ticks7..18, each hostile mob hit once8 damage, vertical +/-3. Painted cyan pressure cels and native Warden sonic sound. No sculk-floor prerequisite. Existing B reveal/resonance consumption retained."
      },
      {
        "property": "sandbox.ancestors_guardian",
        "operation": "replace",
        "before": "Shield presentation emitted on manual V Life Chorus; automatic low-health trait absent.",
        "after": "V:16-block healing front with original golden rune/swirl/mote cels and per-recipient responses; preserve healing/cleanse/full-health absorption and4 outward actual R7 shields with amount*.75 protection for100ticks. Shared player-origin repulsion reaches16blocks/12ticks and knocks each hostile once with native strength.9, no new damage; V starts it at tick7. Successful below40% native golem entry triggers the SAME wave at PLAYER immediately, not golem-centered or recurring. Existing30tick Resistance V and600tick golem retained. Gold storyboard supersedes botanical candidate; old orange bars remain archived USER_REJECTED."
      }
    ]
  },
